The data builders reproduce the prompt templates of the models they prepare data for, so that a teacher is queried
in the format it was trained on: the findings + impression template of UniRG-CXR (microsoft/UniRG-CXR) and the
training and evaluation templates of Med-R1 (yuxianglai117/Med-R1).

MedResidency drives, but does not include, ms-swift (modelscope/ms-swift, Apache-2.0), vLLM (vllm-project/vllm,
Apache-2.0) and RadEval. It contains no data and no model weights: every dataset and model it can download or
process keeps its own licence and terms of use (docs/data.md).
